Recovery Coordinator
Copyright 2026 Summon Labs

This product includes software developed for the Recovery Coordinator
project (https://github.com/summonlabs/Recovery-Coordinator).

The Recovery Coordinator implementation, its public API surface, its command
line tools, and the synthetic adjacent-authority adapters used by its test
suites were all written for this repository. No third-party runtime dependency
is vendored, linked, or required: the SHA-256 and CRC-32C implementations, the
canonical encoders, the strict JSON decoder, the durable journal format, and
the synthetic facility model are part of this distribution.

The synthetic adjacent-authority adapters model the behaviour of a power,
cooling, capacity, workload, and network authority. They do not talk to, and
are not derived from, any real facility management, building management, or
data centre infrastructure product.
